{"ID":"20250918203952-qf8vrst","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250918203952-qf8vrst","title":"UPL6-1——DrawCall","type":"doc","updated":"20250918204618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918203952-r7oy35l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250918203952-r7oy35l","updated":"20250918204422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20250918204107-jmdphdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204107-jmdphdd","updated":"20250918204129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DrawCall（绘制调用）在 Unity 中有时也会被称为 SetPass Call（设置参数调用），本质上是 CPU 向 GPU 发送一条绘制指令\n告诉 GPU 要画什么、怎么画、用什么材质、用哪段几何数据，从 CPU 到 GPU 的一次DrawCall的流程包含:"}]},{"ID":"20250918204132-5hcm7c2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204132-5hcm7c2","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204138-lpqhytl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-lpqhytl","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204138-dqj7anm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-dqj7anm","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU设置渲染状态"}]},{"ID":"20250918204138-jibd8uk","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-jibd8uk","updated":"20250918204140"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204140-9eorxqb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204140-9eorxqb","updated":"20250918204140"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204140-11o8p8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204140-11o8p8l","updated":"20250918204140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绑定要用的 Shader 程序（顶点着色器、片段着色器等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204141-e3snkzw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-e3snkzw","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204141-2sh3x4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-2sh3x4l","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绑定材质参数（纹理、颜色、常量缓冲区）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204141-l7pohqn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-l7pohqn","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204141-g88tily","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-g88tily","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绑定几何数据（网格顶点缓冲、索引缓冲）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204141-qjenlir","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-qjenlir","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204141-57647bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204141-57647bz","updated":"20250918204141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置混合模式、深度测试、剔除方式等 GPU 状态"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204138-6o8z2oq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-6o8z2oq","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204138-qkavpu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-qkavpu2","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU发送绘制命令"}]},{"ID":"20250918204145-4b7ci25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204145-4b7ci25","updated":"20250918204145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"告诉 GPU 从哪块缓冲取数据、绘制多少个顶点/三角形"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204138-8k1tflw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-8k1tflw","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204138-vx9g54f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204138-vx9g54f","updated":"20250918204138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU执行绘制"}]},{"ID":"20250918204146-ji65n8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204146-ji65n8b","updated":"20250918204146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按状态和数据进行顶点处理、光栅化、片元处理等，最终输出到帧缓冲"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204135-023umb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204135-023umb9","updated":"20250918204212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点：一次 DrawCall ≈ 一次 准备渲染状态 + 发送命令，即使画很少的三角形，也有固定的 CPU 提交开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204215-19uuz36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204215-19uuz36","updated":"20250918204218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果 DrawCall 数量过多，会严重影响 CPU 性能"}]},{"ID":"20250918204218-f2e7pbc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918204218-f2e7pbc","updated":"20250918204422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DrawCall 为什么会影响 CPU 性能"}]},{"ID":"20250918204236-felrdvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204236-felrdvg","updated":"20250918204244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"DrawCall 过程中常见的开销："}]},{"ID":"20250918204242-otkhzgc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204242-otkhzgc","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-1iygune","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-1iygune","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-fw6ep7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-fw6ep7s","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"状态切换的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204250-fmvegym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-fmvegym","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 DrawCall 可能要重新绑定材质、贴图、Shader，GPU 需要刷新缓存，CPU 也要组织新的状态命令"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204250-n997r8i","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-n997r8i","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-9gwli32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-9gwli32","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据绑定的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204252-s7l37u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204252-s7l37u6","updated":"20250918204252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为每个批次上传模型矩阵、材质参数等常量缓冲区数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204250-tjczv0r","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-tjczv0r","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-piwvwb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-piwvwb3","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"命令组织的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204253-gq38rnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204253-gq38rnd","updated":"20250918204253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 需要调用驱动 API 生成命令缓冲，驱动内部也会有锁、同步、内存分配等操作"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204250-b9uecgb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-b9uecgb","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-vcbje1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-vcbje1d","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排序与剔除的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204254-61ap5iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204254-61ap5iy","updated":"20250918204254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为减少状态切换，CPU 会在提交前排序批次；有时还要做可见性计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204250-88e597j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-88e597j","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204250-z67yv8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204250-z67yv8z","updated":"20250918204250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多Pass重复提交的开销"}]},{"ID":"20250918204256-s5ycyqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204256-s5ycyqt","updated":"20250918204256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴影、深度、后处理等，每个物体可能需要额外 DrawCall"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204240-s4f3bik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204240-s4f3bik","updated":"20250918204305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250918204308-65fzkm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204308-65fzkm4","updated":"20250918204317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 DrawCall 都需要进行 CPU 准备数据、切换状态、调用图形 API（OpenGL、DirectX 等）等操作，都会有固定的CPU提交成本\n而这些成本会随着DrawCall的数量增多，累积耗时到毫秒级别，从而占满 CPU 渲染线程（Render Thread） 时间"}]},{"ID":"20250918204321-thkvi9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204321-thkvi9v","updated":"20250918204336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并且如果 DrawCall 太多，CPU 花太多时间准备批次，GPU 可能处于等待状态，\n从而导致帧率被 CPU 限制，而 GPU 其实还是空闲状态"}]},{"ID":"20250918204422-9tpe489","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918204422-9tpe489","updated":"20250918204520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Unity 中做什么会增加 DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20250918204440-d9ilrok","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204440-d9ilrok","updated":"20250918204510"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-oj9r30j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-oj9r30j","updated":"20250918204457"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-chkhqy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-chkhqy2","updated":"20250918204457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"材质、Shader 不一致：纹理、颜色、参数不同"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-hdagpyd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-hdagpyd","updated":"20250918204455"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-8b3xl34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-8b3xl34","updated":"20250918204455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相同材质，不同纹理：同一个Shader，但是使用的纹理贴图不同"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-rlocvzl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-rlocvzl","updated":"20250918204459"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-hp63nlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-hp63nlz","updated":"20250918204459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同的渲染队列：不同渲染队列会分开渲染"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-ssnpe49","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-ssnpe49","updated":"20250918204503"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-r5w8u07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-r5w8u07","updated":"20250918204503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同的透明度：透明队列中，Unity 会按深度排序"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-cpo2dfc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-cpo2dfc","updated":"20250918204504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-edovr2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-edovr2o","updated":"20250918204504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不同的Shader变体：看似一个 Shader 文件，但变体不同"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-atpac9b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-atpac9b","updated":"20250918204508"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-s41z9uf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-s41z9uf","updated":"20250918204508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 元素位于不同 Canvas"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204447-5snop2l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-5snop2l","updated":"20250918204510"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204447-23f211g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204447-23f211g","updated":"20250918204510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 中多个 Pass（阴影、深度、后处理等）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204443-4cecmqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204443-4cecmqj","updated":"20250918204443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250918204520-mnby3u5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250918204520-mnby3u5","updated":"20250918204618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 DrawCall 的优化思路"}]},{"ID":"20250918204528-pemjr42","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204528-pemjr42","updated":"20250918204618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204532-uo5xxmj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-uo5xxmj","updated":"20250918204532"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204532-xoe5p8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-xoe5p8d","updated":"20250918204532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合批处理"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204532-3jn2hrw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-3jn2hrw","updated":"20250918204618"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204532-eq2355j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-eq2355j","updated":"20250918204618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合并贴图（将若干个 UI 小图合并为图集）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204532-73kb9yb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-73kb9yb","updated":"20250918204535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204532-r7drgkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-r7drgkw","updated":"20250918204535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少 Shader 变体"}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204532-q2s1ly2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-q2s1ly2","updated":"20250918204536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250918204532-wglqe70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204532-wglqe70","updated":"20250918204536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化 UI"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250918204530-9kg08oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918204530-9kg08oh","updated":"20250918204530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]}